Only synthetic public inputs, configuration and the minimal fill driver are
substituted. This is self-checked diagnostic proof, not independent acceptance,
service/runtime proof, market research, execution replay or evidence of profit.
The saved .before runner and strategy implementations execute in-process: no
subprocess is needed, and production source files are never rewritten.
"""
